WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.620
And we're very grateful for, again,

2
00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:11.460
just kind of showing us how to
do it, showing us how it's done:

3
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:18.120
to live, how to die, how to
be a part of something that's

4
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:24.880
beyond your individual self. I'm

5
00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:30.090
absolutely grateful for the
example that he led for all of us.

6
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:35.520
I don't feel an ounce
of sorrow in this way.

7
00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:40.930
Like, this is something that teaches
me to welcome every aspect of life.
